  "description": "DELIVERY.md §11: SEMP_TRUST_OBSERVATION records are signed by the publishing observer's domain key with the SEMP-TRUST-OBSERVATION: prefix. When evidence_available is true, the observation MUST carry evidence_hash. A consumer fetching evidence_uri MUST compute the digest of the returned bytes under evidence_hash.algorithm and treat a mismatch as a verification failure equivalent to a signature failure.",
