    {
      "id": "trust-observation-size-cap-rejection",
      "description": "Schema-limit negative case. An observation record on the wire MUST NOT exceed 16384 bytes (16 KiB) in canonical UTF-8 JSON form. Servers MUST reject larger records as malformed and MUST NOT propagate them. Senders MAY publish an observation_record_abuse report against publishers that systematically violate the cap.",
